             crm_lead.py create()/write() overrides enforce "own only" on top of
             this (this rule alone can't stop MD reassigning an OWNED lead to
             someone else mid-write, since the domain is only checked against the
             final record). perm_read=False - read is already covered globally by
             rule_crm_lead_mzr_md above; this rule exists purely for write/create. -->
        <record id="rule_crm_lead_mzr_md_own" model="ir.rule">
            <field name="name">Mazenet CRM Lead: MD Own Leads (Create/Edit)</field>
